NE-SAFE WEBSITE
================

Open index.html in any modern browser.

This is a front-end SIH prototype based on the NE-SAFE concept:
- Flood + landslide risk dashboard
- Risk map
- Early-warning alerts
- Citizen emergency reporting
- AI verification concept
- Rescue-resource management
- Shelter/response workflow
- Responsive design

IMPORTANT:
All map markers, percentages, counts and alerts in this prototype are simulated demonstration data.
For a real SIH implementation, connect the UI to validated weather/river/GIS datasets, an ML backend,
official emergency data, authentication and real notification services.
